# Never commit dataset images or labels (Ski 2DPose terms; SkiTB is CC BY-NC).
# Overlays, contact sheets, clips and predictions stay under $SKIER_RESULTS.
# The report's qualitative figure shows dataset frames: it goes to Overleaf only.
final_report/figures/qualitative_*.png
# The local preview of the final report (rebuilt after every report change) contains dataset frames.
final_report_preview.pdf
# The pseudo-label figure (pseudo_fig.py) shows SkiTB training frames (CC BY-NC 4.0).
final_report/figures/pseudo_*.png
# Stills from the STARK demo (stark_demo_stills.sh) are dataset frames too.
final_report/figures/stark_demo/
# Local copies of the demo videos (from $SKIER_RESULTS/final{,_stark}/demos/), for viewing on Windows.
demos/
